Common LocalEducationAgencyFederalFunds
    documentation "Contains the information about the reception and use of federal funds for reporting purposes."
    integer FiscalYear
        documentation "The fiscal year for which the federal funds are received."
        is part of identity
    currency InnovativeDollarsSpent
        documentation "The total Title V, Part A funds expended by LEAs."
        is optional
    currency InnovativeDollarsSpentStrategicPriorities
        documentation "The total amount of Title V, Part A funds expended by LEAs for the four strategic priorities."
        is optional
    currency InnovativeProgramsFundsReceived
        documentation "The total Title V, Part A funds received by LEAs."
        is optional
    currency SchoolImprovementAllocation
        documentation "The amount of Section 1003(a) and 1003(g) allocations to LEAs."
        is optional
    percent SchoolImprovementReservedFundsPercentage
        documentation "An indication of the percentage of the Title I, Part A allocation that the SEA reserved in accordance with Section 1003(a) of ESEA and 200.100(a) of ED's regulations governing the reservation of funds for school improvement under Section 1003(a) of ESEA."
        is optional
    currency SupplementalEducationalServicesFundsSpent
        documentation "The dollar amount spent on supplemental educational services during the school year under Title I, Part A, Section 1116 of ESEA as amended."
        is optional
    currency SupplementalEducationalServicesPerPupilExpenditure
        documentation "The maximum dollar amount that may be spent per child for expenditures related to supplemental educational services under Title I of the ESEA."
        is optional
    percent StateAssessmentAdministrationFunding
        documentation "The percentage of funds used to administer assessments required by Section 1111(b) or to carry out other activities described in Section 6111 and other activities related to ensuring that the state's schools and LEAs are held accountable for results."
        is optional
